{"name":"Fandango","hex":"#b53389","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fandango","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A form of lively flamenco music and dance that has many regional variations (e.g. fandango de Huelva), some of which have their own names (e.g. malagueña, granadina). .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A gathering for dancing; a ball."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To dance the fandango.","To dance, particularly with a lot of energy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fandango"}],"entries":[{"title":"Fandango","blocks":[{"text":"Fandango is a lively partner dance originating in Spain, usually in triple meter, traditionally accompanied by guitars, castanets, tambourine or hand-clapping. Fandango can both be sung and danced. Sung fandango is usually bipartite: it has an instrumental introduction followed by \"variaciones\". Sung fandango usually follows the structure of \"cante\" that consist of four or five octosyllabic verses (coplas) or musical phrases (tercios). Occasionally, the first copla is repeated."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Fandango-chasselat.jpg/330px-Fandango-chasselat.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fandango","wikidata":"Q1130969"},{"title":"Fandango (wrestler)","blocks":[{"text":"Curtis Jonathan Hussey is an American retired professional wrestler and actor. He is signed to Total Nonstop Action Wrestling (TNA) as a producer. He is best known for his tenure with WWE, where he performed under the ring name Fandango from 2013 to 2021."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Johnny_Curtis_in_November_2025.png/330px-Johnny_Curtis_in_November_2025.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fandango_(wrestler)","wikidata":"Q3183352"},{"title":"Fuchsia (color)","blocks":[{"t